{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>From there they journeyed.</b> From the springs of the Ovrim." "<b>And they encamped in Nahal Zered.</b> And in the section of the journeys it is written that two springs came to them at Dibon-Gad, except that there it counts the places, while here it counts the names of the rivers, because it wants to go down and tell the matter of the well."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:58.770419485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}